description=Level 2 v2: wake/boot-safe 144 Hz normal / verified 120 Hz FOD. Pre-arms 120 Hz during sleep/early boot, rechecks wake and repeated overrides, continues bounded retries and reconciles live refresh votes. Retains 0.4x animations, 4266/1866 MHz screen-aware DRAM, HAL patch, HBM safety and download fixes.
